  },
  "mach:accessModel": "open",
  "mach:governance": "community",
  "mach:maturity": "beta",
  "mach:category": "specs",
  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The primary specification for FAIR metadata services in European research data infrastructure, with production deployments at Health-RI and across ELIXIR nodes. Still an Unofficial Proposal Draft at W3C — not yet a formal standard — and the March 2026 draft still targets DCAT v2 rather than the current DCAT v3. The Java reference implementation is functional but known to be heavyweight. Marked Assess: track it closely if building FAIR-aligned health data infrastructure, especially given its role in the EHDS ecosystem, but evaluate whether the spec version and implementation maturity fit your requirements.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-13",
